<title>RUSSIA: SOCCER-RUSSIAN CUP QUARTER-FINAL RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RUSSIAN CUP QUARTER-FINAL RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of a Russian Cup</p>
<p>quarter-final soccer match on Wednesday:</p>
<p> Torpedo LM Moscow	  1 Lokomotiv Moscow   2</p>
<p>Played on Tuesday:</p>
<p> Krylya Sovietov Samara   1 Rotor Volgograd    0</p>
<p>Semifinals (venues to be drawn May 22):</p>
<p>Dynamo Moscow v Zenit St Petersburg (on May 27)</p>
<p>Krylya Sovietov Samara v Lokomotiv Moscow (on May 28)</p>
<p>Final to be played in Moscow on June 11.</p>
